<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Hot and Stupid</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Beth McCarthy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Hot and Stupid</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0B9yMae4fLWvjDQGFKon40</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.486" end="00:06.043">The bathroom mirror's laughing at me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.043" end="00:10.931">'Cause she knows that I'm just one drink away from your sheets</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.931" end="00:15.479">And I told myself I wouldn't be here again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.479" end="00:21.426">But here I am falling for a future ex (Huh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.426" end="00:23.677">It's bad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.677" end="00:27.266">But I think I'll get another glass 'cause</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.266" end="00:30.029">You're hot and I'm stupid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.029" end="00:31.734">I know what's good for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.734" end="00:34.668">And you're not but I'll do it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.668" end="00:36.374">'Cause it's so pretty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.374" end="00:41.278">I didn't wear this underwear for no one to see it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.278" end="00:44.854">So take me home, take it off 'cause baby you're hot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.854" end="00:50.533">And I'm stupid (I'm stupid)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.533" end="00:54.045">You're wearing your red flags on your sleeve</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.045" end="00:58.794">But if I rip off your shirt, I won't even see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.794" end="01:01.099">You're beautiful carnage</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.099" end="01:03.309">You could do a lot of damage</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.309" end="01:06.029">But if you're hеavy handed with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.029" end="01:09.564">I think that I can handle thе heat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.564" end="01:11.844">And it's bad (So bad)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.844" end="01:14.469">But I wanna be the best you had</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.469" end="01:18.063">You're hot and I'm stupid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.063" end="01:19.620">I know what's good for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.620" end="01:22.641">And you're not but I'll do it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.641" end="01:24.282">'Cause it's so pretty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.282" end="01:29.412">I didn't wear this underwear for no one to see it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.412" end="01:32.774">So take me home, take it off 'cause baby you're hot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.774" end="01:35.080">And I'm stupid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.080" end="01:39.303">Little miss chaotic always seems to show up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.303" end="01:41.657">When I think I'm done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.657" end="01:44.614">Healing, healing (Who was I kidding?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.614" end="01:48.674">Wish I didn't want it but there's something so fun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.674" end="01:54.188">'Bout the red wine drunk feeling, I feel it, I feel your</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.188" end="01:57.700">Bedroom mirror laughing at me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.700" end="02:03.149">'Cause she knows that I like the way I look in your sheets</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.149" end="02:04.649">Oops</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.320" end="02:07.091">You're hot and I'm stupid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.091" end="02:08.798">I know what's good for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.798" end="02:11.831">And you're not but I'll do it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.831" end="02:13.531">'Cause it's so pretty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.531" end="02:18.386">I didn't wear this underwear for no one to see it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.386" end="02:21.972">So take me home, get me off 'cause baby we're hot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.972" end="02:25.972">And stupid</p></div></body></tt>